      {
        "id": "p23-q-cont",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "",
        "prompt": "A student is chosen at random. What is the probability that they solve:",
        "layout": "grid",
        "columns": 2,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "p23-q-cont-a",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "a",
            "prompt": "exactly two of the problems?",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{13}{20}$",
              "worked": "The three percentages for exactly two problems describe disjoint groups; the 5% who solve all three are excluded.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{exactly two})&=\\frac{15+35+15}{100}\\\\P(\\text{exactly two})&=\\frac{65}{100}=\\frac{13}{20}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 24
          },
          {
            "id": "p23-q-cont-b",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "b",
            "prompt": "none of the problems?",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{1}{5}$\n\nFind the disjoint regions, then subtract their total probability from 1.",
              "worked": "Subtract the pair-only and all-three percentages from each problem's total to obtain its single-problem region.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Problem 1 only}&=60\\%-15\\%-35\\%-5\\%=5\\%\\\\\\text{Problem 2 only}&=40\\%-15\\%-15\\%-5\\%=5\\%\\\\\\text{Problem 3 only}&=55\\%-35\\%-15\\%-5\\%=0\\%\\end{align*}$$\nThe seven disjoint regions together give the percentage solving at least one problem.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{at least one})&=\\frac{5+5+0+15+35+15+5}{100}\\\\P(\\text{at least one})&=\\frac{80}{100}\\\\P(\\text{none})&=1-\\frac{80}{100}\\\\P(\\text{none})&=\\frac{20}{100}=\\frac15\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 66
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
